    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dogs are hiding again! This time they are miniature dogs taking a relaxing vacation in Brazil, exploring the Amazon, sitting on Selar\u00f3n\u2019s Steps, and taking a look at historical monuments and refreshing parks!<br>Can you find them all? Zoom in if you can\u2019t find them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 dogs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost dog finder (hint system if you're stuck)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game Settings (Gamma slider, bgm volume and dog volume)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works on Windows! (Mac, and Steamdeck will be added later)</p>",
